  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Reform and Governance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Reforma Fiscal y Gobernabilidad</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de este programa es apoyar al pas en la reforma de la gestin financiera pblica tanto de egresos como de ingresos y en la normativa que rige las reas del gasto y tributos internos y aduanas. El programa complementar las acciones del prstamo 1499SF-HA, apoyo a la reforma fiscal, el cual se centro el aspectos de mejoramiento de la administracin del gasto, as como del Programa de Reforma a la Gobernabilidad Econmica recientemente aprobado por el Banco Mundial.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this program is to support the country&apos;s efforts towards the improvement of public financial management, both in the expenditure and revenue institutions and the legal framework that norms their actions, both in expenditure and internal revenue and customs. This program will complement the actions undertaken with loan 1499SF-HA, support for fiscal reform, which centered on improving the administration of public expenditure, and those supported by the Economic Governance Reform Operation recently approved by the World Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
